<http://www.ebi.ac.uk/efo/EFO_0000408> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A disease is a disposition that describes states of disease associated with a particular sample and/or organism." .
<http://www.ebi.ac.uk/efo/EFO_0000408> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A disease is a disposition to undergo pathological processes that exists in an organism because of one or more disorders in that organism." .
